":0.839,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-5-3"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3004005","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"6fb1f25dac5b84cec10c1810704659f821c8d814f9eeed55298e8c6f25deb4b2","compact":"9799147d8c4137f8285993e36d9f4da014cb8a3734aaf83b04112dfb77af98ee","nasal":"2d81f4a0d535132d2a2906ab838fb6c9041cc7ff8a3956c83e1be353f19e8d1a"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-4-6","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":4,"verse":6,"english":"He saw the lord of the celestials, possessed of a resplendent person, resembling in effulgence the sun or Vaisvanara-mounted on a superb car (saw) him that is followed by all the celestials, stationed in the sky, not touching the earth, adorned in luminous ornaments-the god dressed in a clean appear! Worshipped by many a high-should personage dressed in the same way. And from a distance, (Rāma) saw the car stationed in the sky yoked with green steeds-resembling the infant sun;","alignment":{"type":"split","confidence":0.466,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-5-3","DUTT-3-5-4"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3004006","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"7f0a155c7cee38c86eb5235a39e00c4212dca4f8a9129e022d1fe1e880c61ddd","compact":"c165815c6ec5f06639eeedb64110b75f80b87d1ece84e24669230bd5c30fb43d","nasal":"3c2ecd6d889102e5510428c60173a2d60e975c17fccdf1a218bb75fbf59a00c7"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-4-7","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":4,"verse":7,"english":"Worshipped by many a high-should personage dressed in the same way. And from a distance, (Rāma) saw the car stationed in the sky yoked with green steeds-resembling the infant sun;","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.919,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-5-4"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3004007","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–